{"publicId":"de6d53da-80aa-4d3c-82aa-96d870445b71","title":"Canton Network TSV平台启动SEC创新豁免下CNTN代币化股票交易","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-10-29T16:27:39.000Z","latestAt":"2026-10-29T16:27:39.000Z","digest":"Canton Network旗下TSV平台于2026年11月2日在SEC创新豁免框架下启动纳斯达克上市公司CNTN的代币化股票交易，成为首例合规证券代币化美股交易。该平台通过SEC注册的Fairmint TA LLC实现链上过户，绕过传统30天发行人异议期限制，代币化股票享有与纳斯达克原股完全相同的股东权益并支持24/7交易。当前交易已记录30,296美元购买额，但法律效力仍取决于SEC最终审批。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-05T19:10:50.204Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"纳斯达克上市公司 Canton Strategic Holdings 计划推出代币化股票交易","latestReport":{"id":"takmw5k2lm475m7b6e1qql2nx"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fIFTeKgFR1QU","title":"Canton Strategic Holdings plans to tokenize its common share","firstReportAt":"2026-10-29T16:27:39.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"takmw5k2lm475m7b6e1qql2nx","title":"纳斯达克上市公司 Canton Strategic Holdings 计划推出代币化股票交易","summary":"纳斯达克上市公司 Canton Strategic Holdings 计划于11月2日推出代币化股票交易。该公司与TSV LLC（交易场所）和Fairmint（SEC注册转移代理）合作，代币化股票将享有与纳斯达克股票相同的股东权益。","source":{"name":"Cointelegraph","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-10-29T16:27:39.000Z","selected":true}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"takmw5k2lm475m7b6e1qql2nx","title":"纳斯达克上市公司 Canton Strategic Holdings 计划推出代币化股票交易","summary":"纳斯达克上市公司 Canton Strategic Holdings 计划于11月2日推出代币化股票交易。该公司与TSV LLC（交易场所）和Fairmint（SEC注册转移代理）合作，代币化股票将享有与纳斯达克股票相同的股东权益。","source":{"name":"Cointelegraph","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-10-29T16:27:39.000Z","selected":true}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-05T20:00:00.000Z","heat":5.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T21:00:00.000Z","heat":5.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T22:00:00.000Z","heat":5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T23:00:00.000Z","heat":4.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T00:00:00.000Z","heat":4.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T01:00:00.000Z","heat":4.6